The box above must scroll rather than grow. It must also stay **copyable and printable**:
that is why the bound is a scroll box and not `hidden="until-found"`, whose fallback on an
engine without the reveal is `display: none`.

## A frame with too many rows {#sec-dense-table}

The wrapper opens here and closes after the table, so the raw-HTML root spans several
blocks. That idiom is load-bearing: `render/emit.rs`'s `is_single_root` counts an unclosed
root as one root, and this document is the corpus witness for it.

